{"ref":"BDB, אִכָּר","hw":"אִכָּר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אִכָּר</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Joel 1:11\" href=\"/Joel.1.11\">Jo 1:11</a></sup> <strong>ploughman, husbandman (</strong>Ar. <span dir=\"rtl\">أَكَّارٌ</span>, Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐܰܟܳܪܳܐ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אִיכָּרָא</span>, cf. Mish.<strong>)</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> sg. abs. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:23\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.23\">Je 51:23</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">וְצִמְדּוֹ</span>) <a data-ref=\"Amos 5:16\" href=\"/Amos.5.16\">Am 5:16</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">אִכָּרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 14:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.14.4\">Je 14:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.24\">31:24</a>(<a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:23\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.23\">23</a>) (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">וְנָֽסְעוּ בָעֵדֶר</span>) <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:10\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.10\">2 Ch 26:10</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כֹּרְמִים</span>) <a data-ref=\"Joel 1:11\" href=\"/Joel.1.11\">Jo 1:11</a> (‖ <em>id.</em>), <span dir=\"rtl\">אִכָּרֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 61:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.61.5\">Is 61:5</a> (‖ <em>id.</em>)","next":"BDB, אַכְשָׁף","prev":"BDB, אכר"}